### Rejestracja nowego właściciela studia
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "zuziamajczyk@gmail.com",
  "password": "Haslo1234!",
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "studio": {
    "name": "elo elo",
    "address": "ul. Krakowska 1, 30-001 Kraków"
  }
}

### Rejestracja — email już zajęty (oczekiwany: 409 EMAIL_TAKEN)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@detailflow.pl",
  "password": "Haslo1234!",
  "firstName": "Jan",
  "lastName": "Kowalski",
  "studio": {
    "name": "Drugie Studio",
    "address": "ul. Warszawska 1"
  }
}

### Rejestracja — brak wymaganych pól (oczekiwany: 400)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "",
  "studio": {
    "name": ""
  }
}


### Zaproszenie nowego pracownika (nie istnieje w systemie)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: 65399519-4d06-4e7e-8489-54c23ae54a50

{
  "email": "zuziamajczyk@gmail.com",
  "roleId": 2
}


### Zaproszenie istniejącego użytkownika (Owner innego studia lub były pracownik)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
#X-Studio-Id: jakies inne niz to powyzej

{
  "email": "zuziamajczyk@gmail.com",
  "roleId": 3
}

### EDGE CASE — self-invite (oczekiwany: 409 SELF_INVITE)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

{
  "email": "owner@detailflow.pl",
  "roleId": 3
}

### EDGE CASE — użytkownik już jest pracownikiem tego studia (oczekiwany: 409 ALREADY_MEMBER)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

{
  "email": "pracownik.jan@gmail.com",
  "roleId": 3
}

### EDGE CASE — aktywne zaproszenie już istnieje (oczekiwany: 409 INVITATION_PENDING)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

{
  "email": "drugie.zaproszenie@gmail.com",
  "roleId": 3
}

### EDGE CASE — próba zaproszenia na rolę Owner (oczekiwany: 409 CANNOT_INVITE_OWNER) (mozna np 2 ownerow moze byc)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

{
  "email": "nowy.owner@gmail.com",
  "roleId": 1
}

### EDGE CASE — nieprawidłowy format email (oczekiwany: 400 walidacja)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

{
  "email": "to-nie-jest-email",
  "roleId": 3
}

### EDGE CASE — brak autoryzacji (oczekiwany: 401)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pracownik@gmail.com",
  "roleId": 3
}

### EDGE CASE — zalogowany jako pracownik, nie Owner (oczekiwany: 403)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{employee_auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

{
  "email": "kolejny@gmail.com",
  "roleId": 3
}

### Ponowne wysłanie zaproszenia (resend)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite/{{invitation_id}}/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

### EDGE CASE — resend już zaakceptowanego zaproszenia (oczekiwany: 400 ALREADY_ACCEPTED)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite/{{accepted_invitation_id}}/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

### EDGE CASE — resend zaproszenia z innego studia (oczekiwany: 400 FORBIDDEN)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite/{{other_studio_invitation_id}}/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

### EDGE CASE — resend nieistniejącego zaproszenia (oczekiwany: 404 NOT_FOUND)
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/employees/invite/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/resend
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
X-Studio-Id: {{studio_id}}

### GET Invitation
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/invitations/015793e0-328a-47bc-b91e-ce2f531397fd
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}